starfish.damage,55,1,120,"starfish damage per hit. Raised 22 -> 55, the SECOND buff this row has had: the first move (232 -> 1,767 damage per stack-minute) took it off the floor but left it bottom three, still returning 0.02-0.30x its weight and never once above 0.30x. The shuriken pierces, so damage is the honest lever — cadence is already at 0.42s."
