club.twirl.spin,24,0,34,"club twirl: rad/sec a kept fin club is driven to while a dash is live. THIS IS ITS DAMAGE - every club hit is scaled by the club's own measured spin - so it is set against three other numbers, not by eye: over powerReference x powerMax (14.4) so its hits are at the swing ceiling, over shock.fullSwing (22) so it cracks a full-grade shockwave, and under maxSwing (34) or that cap owns this value instead"
