airborne.fireRateMul,1,0,3,"air time: extra fire rate at full ramp. 1 = the gun goes DOUBLE TIME at the top of the ramp, which is the only value that keeps it on the bar grid (see CONFIG.weapon.beatLock). The ramp is continuous, so snapToBarGrid steps it: the gear change lands where the ramp crosses sqrt(2), about 41% up"
